# Firefox Sync: the background task that fetches the tabs and close requests other devices sent
# (ReceiveTabsTask.java in src/chrome/browser/firefox_sync/android), at the receive interval while
# the browser is in the background or not running, and once after a push through Sunup that came
# while it wasn't running. Their ids are after Chromium's last. The manifest has the receiver and
# service UnifiedPush asks for (SunupPush.java).
